	"descriptionMarkdown": "The Imperious - A Nineball class warship\n\nThis is my Aquilo ready ship. Fuel can easily withstand multiple round trips. Ammo can make a round trip no problem but rockets may need some delays at planets to refuel if you are making non-stop trips to inner planets and back. Better mods and quality will be the next thing I add to this.\n\n- Thrusters are controlled via pulse timer to control speed and efficiency.\n- Rockets are set to only shoot the big chonkers so this is perfectly safe to travel in the inner planets without wasting all your ammo.\n- Limits are set on the items on the inner belt (bowels) and extras that exceed the maximum are ejected out. Display panels show needed items. \n- Asteroid collectors are filtered to only grab things needed to properly fill the bowels via the red wire on the power poles (veins). Copper wire is removed on poles.\n- The 3 crushers will change recipes depending on what is needed more. Basic recipe produces more t2 items (ice, carbon, iron) than the advanced processing for instance. \n- The rainbow bridge tunnels have 3 belts combined on each side. Red carries ammo down and to the wings. Blue carries collector materials down to the bowels. Green carries materials from the bowels up to be processed into ammo.\n- Nuclear is temperature controlled via combinator. Empty cells are returned to the bowels and ejected out.\n- Lamp visual readouts for temperature, both fuels, and water.\n- All lasers firing at the same time can overcap the power usage super briefly. I haven't seen this having any issues or delays as it only happens during travel and they rarely all fire at the same time or for very long. Don't add more, the responsible person might even remove a couple.",
